        376.36,
        92.09,
        376.36
      ],
      "text": "The Directorate of Education , Government of NCT of Delhi , is pleased to announce the organisation of various student - centric activities under \" Sewa Sankalp Abhiyan \" , with the objective of providing students an opportunity to express their ideas , creativity and aspirations relating to public service , development , nation - building and the vision of \" Viksit Bharat @ 2047 \" . The Abhiyan seeks to highlight the journey of public service over the past 25 years and create awareness among students regarding various welfare and development initiatives . Accordingly , all Heads of Government Schools of NCT of Delhi are directed to ensure active participation of students in the following competitions :"
    },
